---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Privacy Policy — HomeDIYCalcs"
  description="How HomeDIYCalcs handles data, cookies, and your privacy."
>
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl text-ink mb-4">
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mb-10">
      Last updated: May 5, 2026
    </p>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-ink leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        This policy explains how HomeDIYCalcs ("we", "our", "the site") collects and uses information when you visit this website.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-ink mt-10 mb-4">Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        HomeDIYCalcs is operated by Marlin Tanner, based in Pfäffikon ZH, Switzerland. Contact: <a href="mailto:info@homediycalcs.com" style="color: var(--color-accent);" class="hover:underline">info@homediycalcs.com</a>.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-ink mt-10 mb-4">What data we collect</h2>
      <p>We collect minimal data:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2">
        <li><strong>Calculator inputs:</strong> All calculations happen in your browser. We do not store the numbers you enter.</li>
        <li><strong>Anonymous analytics:</strong> We use standard web analytics to understand which pages are visited. No personal information is collected.</li>
        <li><strong>Advertising cookies:</strong> If we display ads (via Google AdSense), Google and its partners may use cookies to show personalized advertising. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" style="color: var(--color-accent);" class="hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google's ad policies</a>.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-ink mt-10 mb-4">Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        Cookies are small files stored in your browser. We use cookies for:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2">
        <li>Anonymous analytics (page views, browser type)</li>
        <li>Advertising (if applicable)</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        You can disable cookies in your browser settings. Disabling them will not affect the calculator functionality.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-ink mt-10 mb-4">Third-party services</h2>
      <p>This site uses the following third-party services:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2">
        <li><strong>Vercel</strong> — hosting (United States, GDPR-compliant)</li>
        <li><strong>Google AdSense</strong> — advertising and analytics (when active)</li>
        <li><strong>Google Search Console</strong> — site indexing (no user data exposed)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-ink mt-10 mb-4">Your rights (GDPR / Swiss DSG)</h2>
      <p>You have the right to:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2">
        <li>Request access to data we hold about you</li>
        <li>Request deletion of any personal data</li>
        <li>Object to data processing</li>
        <li>File a complaint with the Swiss Federal Data Protection Commissioner (FDPIC)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-ink mt-10 mb-4">Data retention</h2>
      <p>
        We do not store personal data on our servers. Anonymous analytics data is retained for up to 26 months by Google.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-ink mt-10 mb-4">Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For privacy-related questions, contact us at <a href="mailto:info@homediycalcs.com" style="color: var(--color-accent);" class="hover:underline">info@homediycalcs.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>